        Acey-Deucey, v1.30 README! file by Dotoran of Frontiers BBS!
============================================================================

    This is one of the first files I ever wrote, over SIX years ago for
CNet Amiga. I've updated it to work 100% under the new CNet Amiga, v4.xx!

    Simply place the Acey_Deucey file wherever you want to and add it as an
ARexx Door. It's a single player game, with 3 pseudo-computer opponents(if
the user requests to use them).

    All game docs are built-in, so will not be discussed here. Some newer
error checking, random number routines, pause routines, etc. were added to
bring this file "up to grade".

    If you have any problems, please give a buzz!

